@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 15
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam sequence {
 ArrowColor #139D90
 LifeLineBorderColor #A5BFC2
 ParticipantBackgroundColor #183840
 ParticipantBorderColor #183840
 ParticipantFontColor white
 ActorBorderColor #183840
 ActorFontColor #183840
 GroupBorderColor #139D90
 GroupBackgroundColor #EAF6F3
 GroupHeaderFontColor #183840
 NoteBackgroundColor #FFF1E7
 NoteBorderColor #F66B22
}
actor Student
participant Frontend as FE
participant "REST Controller" as API
participant ProfileService as S
database PostgreSQL as DB
title Save my full profile | US-04
Student -> FE: Save profile
FE -> API: HTTPS PUT /api/v1/profiles/me\nAuthorization: Bearer <access_token>\nProfileInput (JSON)
ref over FE, DB
matching_00_authentication: validate JWT, ACTIVE account, STUDENT role
end ref

API -> S: saveProfile(verified sub, input)
S -> DB: Validate subject UUIDs and read current profile
DB --> S: Known subjects / existing profile
alt invalid required fields or unknown subject
 S --> API: VALIDATION_ERROR; no write
 API --> FE: 422 + ErrorEnvelope
else valid input
 S -> DB: Atomic INSERT or full UPDATE for sub
 DB --> S: Profile + created flag
 S --> API: Profile + created flag
 alt first profile created
  API --> FE: 201 Created + Profile\nLocation: /api/v1/profiles/me
 else existing profile replaced
  API --> FE: 200 OK + Profile
 end
end
FE --> Student: Saved profile or validation feedback
@enduml
